  "compiler_profile_binding": "Immutable source/profile/sender test executed before each GCC and Clang invocation; flags exactly match trusted installed map CPPFLAGS; full unchanged configured headers, no overrides or forced headers. All original output bytes matched; supplemental exact C++ type assertions passed.",
  "mypy_scope": "Author strict config skips unrelated project imports, but follows pytest/_pytest normally; this is scoped, not whole-project approval. Fresh isolated byte-identical stdlib-only module uses strict/warn_unreachable and follow_imports=normal; separate author module+test check retained.",
  "semantics": {
    "allowed_locations": "pc_equippoint permitted slots, not class/sex/level eligibility",
    "wear_state": "actual received it->equip, including zero",
    "inventory_index": "client_index(server_index)=server_index+2, not itemID or actorID",
    "empty_list": "empty one-frame equipment list only; not whole inventory completion",
    "options": "retain all 5 signed index/value and uint8 param slots plus received option_count",
    "unknown_item_effects": "not evaluated or mapped to zero bonuses",
    "expiry": "raw signed stamp only",
    "max_inventory": "compiler observes 100; not imposed as current legal capacity by this pure representation codec",
    "ack": "raw result preserved with optional known enum; no session/epoch/request correlation or state application"
  },
  "limitations": [
    "No live packets sent, connections, SQL, model, network or service effects; no source repairs or shared packet-table reads/writes.",
    "Known inherited 0999/099A stream registration gap is a parent integration blocker, not a pure decoder defect; not independently re-read while parallel writer active.",
    "Empty one-frame equipment list is not whole inventory completion; parent reported actual empty complete fixtures separately, not proven here.",
    "Ownership, legal class/level/gender/slot, current session and equipment state are not encoder guarantees. Future actor must correlate epoch/index/intent plus actual WearState and ACK; server early returns can emit no ACK.",
    "Raw card/refine/sprite/expiry/options and spare bits do not establish mechanical effects. All five signed option slots survive zero count as native sender requires.",
    "MAX_INVENTORY=100 and 600-row static list allocation do not authorize an inferred dynamic capacity; codec validates positive signed16 frame length instead.",
    "Dataclass constructors can be forged and are not hostile-RPC validation endpoints; public frame decoders strictly deny bytes subclasses, bytearray, memoryview and strings.",
    "No actual gear acquisition/received gear/native equip acceptance. Current MVP cannot equip before an NPC supplies an actual item.",
    "No generic all-path C++ proof, whole moving-source gate or full Renewal parity. Parent owns final combined gates.",
    "Author initial scratch MAX_ITEM_OPTIONS compile error and finite budget overrun remain recorded; successful later compilation does not erase them."
  ],
